==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~14 seconds<sup>300f~420f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Marching Kory]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Despite them having been completely replaced by the [[War on Valentines#War on Valentines|War on Valentines]] stages in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], Mallow March, [[Marzi Pain]] and [[Cavity Creeping]] are still used in the example screenshot for the [[Timed Score Reward|Timed Score]] Stages section of the main help page.

